%% 目标合同：创建话题流程（UC15）
%% 说明：此图描述 InteractionFrame 目标架构，不表示当前 im:* Emit 已替换。
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CreatorUI as 创建者平台 UI
    participant CreatorHelix as 创建者 Helix IM
    participant CreatorDriver as 创建者 Driver
    participant Service as IM 服务端
    participant MemberDriver as 受邀成员 Driver
    participant MemberHelix as 受邀成员 Helix IM
    participant MemberUI as 受邀成员平台 UI

    Note over CreatorUI: 成员选择器、抽屉、路由与动画是端侧 UI，不是 IM 业务 Store。
    CreatorUI->>CreatorHelix: invoke(ActionBinding: create-topic,<br/>parentChannelId, rootMessageId, selectedUserIds, input)
    CreatorHelix->>CreatorHelix: 校验创建权限、父频道生命周期、根消息、成员资格与重复关联
    alt 本地校验拒绝
        CreatorHelix-->>CreatorUI: ActionReceipt rejected(validationErrors)
    else 已受理
        CreatorHelix-->>CreatorUI: ActionReceipt accepted(requestId)
        CreatorHelix->>CreatorDriver: Effect Http(POST /makeTopic)
        CreatorDriver->>Service: create topic with correlation
        alt HTTP 失败或权威事实未收敛完整
            Service-->>CreatorDriver: error or incomplete acknowledgement
            CreatorDriver-->>CreatorHelix: EffectResult Failed or missing correlated facts
            CreatorHelix-->>CreatorDriver: 仅在已定义的强类型 Surface VM 中发出失败过程态
            CreatorDriver-->>CreatorUI: 渲染失败；不修改 topicCount 或 root topicLink Ready
            Note over CreatorHelix,CreatorUI: 失败绝不能由端侧假设成功或自行递增计数。
        else 服务端创建成功
            Service-->>CreatorDriver: HTTP accepted
            Service-->>CreatorDriver: WS channel_created and post_update
            CreatorDriver-->>CreatorHelix: HostObservation WS events
            CreatorHelix->>CreatorHelix: 收敛 Channel、ChannelMember、TopicLink 与 root Message<br/>校验同一 correlation 的事实齐全后持久化
            CreatorHelix->>CreatorDriver: Effect Persist(topic transaction facts)
            CreatorDriver-->>CreatorHelix: EffectResult Persisted
            CreatorHelix->>CreatorHelix: Topic、Timeline、Dialog、Summary、Roster Projector
            CreatorHelix-->>CreatorDriver: InteractionFrame creator final (同一 transactionId)<br/>timeline Patch(root MessageVm.topic_link=Ready)<br/>channel-summary Patch(topic_count + 1)<br/>left-dialog-list PatchRow(topicCount + 1)<br/>topic-list Insert or ReplaceWindow (仅已 attach)<br/>member-roster Patch or ReplaceWindow (仅已 attach)
            CreatorDriver-->>CreatorUI: 所有已 attach surface 原子 apply

            Service-->>MemberDriver: WS channel_created (受邀成员可见的新话题频道)
            MemberDriver-->>MemberHelix: HostObservation WsEvent(channel_created)
            MemberHelix->>MemberHelix: 按 member userId 投影其可见频道和能力
            MemberHelix-->>MemberDriver: InteractionFrame member final<br/>left-dialog-list Insert topic channel<br/>channel-summary or member-roster snapshot (仅已 attach)
            MemberDriver-->>MemberUI: 原子 apply；平台自行决定以列表、页面或抽屉展示
        end
    end

    Note over CreatorHelix,MemberHelix: 每位 viewer 收到自己的强类型 Frame；同一业务事务的计数、关联和可见性由 Helix 裁决，不由客户端拼接 WS 事件。
